        "title": "THE IMMERSION - 5 FULL DAYS",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "text": "<p>The immersion training will begin at the designated training site from 10am to approximately 8-10pm each day. For private immersions the start and end time may be shifted. </p><ul><li>A healthy lunch and snacks will be provided each day.</li><li>You are responsible for your breakfast and dinner.</li></ul><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">PRIOR TO THE EVENT</span></p><p>One you are registered, you will receive a welcome letter with all the details related to your immersion. Your welcome letter will also give you access to our training portal where you get early access to four of the basic power building techniques.</p><p>You are responsible for your lodging and transportation and we may be able to provide lodging & transportation recommendations for you. (For most of our events that will involve flying into Salt Lake City and drive to Ogden).</p>",
        "button_label": "Join Now",
        "button_link": "#offer",
        "button_style": "primary",
        "align_text": "left",
        "image_width": "50",
        "layout": "right",
