        "2916552a-4524-4aff-acbc-634e4afb6d00": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "right",
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "The Fjords",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Explore the stunning and rugged coastline of Norway with its majestic fjords and steep cliffs.</p>",
            "dropdown_html": "<ul>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n</ul>",
            "dropdown_image": "shopify://shop_images/Copy_of_AdobeStock_559032539.jpg",
            "background_color": "#2e2767",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "aaa35b1a-8f7f-40b4-88b2-307c26dd6c43": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "right",
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "The Mountains",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Ascend towering peaks and find the thrill of accomplishment with a guided hike through the mountains of Norway.</p>",
            "dropdown_html": "<ul>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n</ul>",
            "dropdown_image": "shopify://shop_images/Copy_of_saebo-norway.jpg",
            "background_color": "#2e2767",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "643bace9-4996-4be4-b931-2de728a157a3": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "right",
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "The Forests",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Discover the tranquility and beauty of Norway's lush forests and let nature guide your thoughts and emotions.</p>",
            "dropdown_html": "<ul>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n</ul>",
            "dropdown_image": "shopify://shop_images/AdobeStock_589365396.jpg",
            "background_color": "#2e2767",
            "text_color": "#f4f5f7"
          }
        },
        "cab40b70-71f5-4157-900c-344ccf2d5e06": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "right",
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Viking Village",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>During our stay in Gudvangen, we have special access to the Viking Village. The entire area has been named “Viking Valley.”<br/><br/>It is a living cultural historical site, built thematically as a Viking village.  Here, captivating stories of the Vikings and the era are retold without the typical museum experience, but through a real life viking experience.</p><ul><li>The carvings are all based on Viking Age findings.</li><li>The houses in the Viking Village were built with experience from previous Viking reconstructions with local materials.</li><li>The ironworks, hinges and locks are all handmade by a blacksmith with life-long experience with the craft.</li><li>Paint used in the decorations throughout the village is all authentically made.</li><li>The construction of the village only utilized materials that would be found throughout the fjord like peat and shingle similar to the old stave churches.</li></ul>",
            "dropdown_html": "<ul>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n</ul>",
            "dropdown_image": "shopify://shop_images/Copy_of_DSC01542.jpg",
            "background_color": "#2e2767",
            "text_color": "#f4f5f7"
          }
        },
        "bd48c292-e8fb-405b-9fc2-3e92ec363226": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "right",
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "The Great Pyramid",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Precisely aligned within a fraction of a degree to Earth’s cardinal directions, the Great Pyramid is an unprecedented architectural marvel. While its origin has been attributed to the Egyptian Old Kingdom Pharaoh Khufu (aka Cheops), no remains were ever found, shrouding the original construction of this colossal monument in further mystery.</p>",
            "dropdown_html": "<ul>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n</ul>",
            "dropdown_image": "shopify://shop_images/Great_Pyramid_2.jpg",
            "background_color": "#2e2767",
            "text_color": "#f4f5f7"
          }
        }
      },
