    "a9222eb4-8d59-40cd-9ce4-bad54c0c56ad": {
      "type": "text-and-image",
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Vibravision-Mike-Z-Headshot.png",
        "image_mask": "rounded",
        "image2_mask": "none",
        "subtitle": "",
        "title": "Meet Your Vibravision® Chief Instructor",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "text": "<h3><strong>Mike Zeleznick</strong></h3><p>Chief Instructor Mas Mike Zeleznick has spent over 30 years in martial arts, earning two 3rd Degree Black Belts, a 2nd Degree Black Belt, and ranks in 23 other martial arts. An undefeated tournament fighter for 6.5 years, he has also trained police, military, and security professionals. Discovering Merpati Putih (MP) and Vibravision® (VV) in 1999 was a transformative moment for him, making him one of the first non-Indonesians to learn these ancient secrets.</p><p>Key highlights of Chief Instructor Mas Mike’s journey include:</p><ul><li>Holds the world record for breaking 25 stacked iron bars.</li><li>Highest Ranking MP member in North and South America.</li><li>Earned Senior Trainer Rank of Level 9 from the MP Master Council in Indonesia.</li><li>Trained extensively in Indonesia with Royal Heirs and Special Forces.</li><li>Only person permitted to modify and update the traditional MP system for modern needs.</li><li>Developed comprehensive training curricula for MP & Vibravision in America.</li><li>Founded MP USA to teach Merpati Putih to all ages.</li></ul><p>As MP USA and Vibravision’s Chief Instructor, Mas Mike is dedicated to empowering people and proving the efficacy of this ancient technology to Western audiences. He continues to expand the reach of Vibravision® through in-person and online instruction, sharing his message of love and empowerment. As Mas Mike always says, “We’re just getting started!”</p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "primary",
        "align_text": "left",
        "image_width": "33",
        "layout": "left",
        "color_scheme": "3",
        "show_wave": true,
        "divider": false,
        "top_padding": true,
        "bottom_padding": true,
        "lazyload_images": true
      }
    },
    "text_and_image_JPgmwm": {
      "type": "text-and-image",
      "disabled": true,
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Ash_Bio.jpg",
        "image_mask": "rounded",
        "image2_mask": "none",
        "subtitle": "",
        "title": "Learn From Incredible Experts",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "text": "<h3><strong>Essence of Ash</strong></h3><p>Ash is an Archaeologist, Völva (a female practitioner of magic divination and prophecy), Artist, and Facilitator of Northern Sorcery. The old magic traditions of Scandinavia, and the wisdom of the wilderness are her sources of inspiration. <br/><br/>Her journey with the runes began over eleven years ago as a way to deepen connection to Norwegian roots. Ash’s teachings revolve around daily practice, ceremony, and nurturing relationships with Norse gods and goddesses. <br/><br/>She provides mentorship, divination, hand-poke tattoos, and crafted ritual tools. Her work is grounded in respect, integrity and awe for the primal power of the runes.</p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "primary",
        "align_text": "left",
        "image_width": "33",
        "layout": "left",
        "color_scheme": "none",
        "show_wave": false,
        "divider": false,
        "top_padding": true,
        "bottom_padding": true,
        "lazyload_images": true
      }
    },
    "text_and_image_GJCWXG": {
      "type": "text-and-image",
      "disabled": true,
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/CS_01048.jpg",
        "image_mask": "rounded",
        "image2_mask": "none",
        "subtitle": "",
        "title": "",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "text": "<h3><strong>Kaedrich Olsen</strong></h3><p>Kaedrich Olsen, <strong>seen on </strong><em><strong>Gaia</strong></em><strong> shows</strong>, is an internationally renowned author, speaker, and teacher who specializes in divergent paths of spiritual growth.</p><p>Author of Runes for Transformation, published by Red Wheel/ Weiser, taps into the depths of your mind to connect with the runes within, to bring change into the world around you. Founder and composer of GaldraKraft: combining runes, ritual, music and magic for an immersive experience in the power of rune song.</p><p>From seances at an early age, to a lifetime of esoteric practices (including runes and Norse mysticism), he is ideally suited to help you discover your own sacred path through life, and beyond.</p><p>His offerings include: Spiritual Guidance, Pagan Men’s Spirituality, Shadow Work & Paranormal Arts Training </p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "primary",
        "align_text": "left",
        "image_width": "33",
        "layout": "left",
        "color_scheme": "none",
        "show_wave": false,
        "divider": false,
        "top_padding": true,
        "bottom_padding": true,
        "lazyload_images": true
      }
    },
