    "05a6ccb4-5008-4aea-bd7b-71a71b3b7286": {
      "type": "text-with-icons",
      "blocks": {
        "template--20197640634689__05a6ccb4-5008-4aea-bd7b-71a71b3b7286-text_block-1": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "",
            "title": "What is Vibravision®?",
            "text": "<p>Vibravision®is a revolutionary, proven personal energy (Chi) management system based on a 500+-year-old closely guarded and highly-refined Indonesian energetic martial arts practice. It has been updated with the latest in modern training strategies and gamification to take what once took many years to learn and condensed it down to five (5) day Immersion experiences. It uses unique combinations of movement, breath, meditation, and visualization to build, store, perceive, manage, and project subtle energy, tune personal awareness far beyond the normal five senses, create energetic connection of mind-body-spirit, and manage energetic flow and balance for exceptional health and vitality.</p>"
          }
        },
        "template--20197640634689__05a6ccb4-5008-4aea-bd7b-71a71b3b7286-text_block-3": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "",
            "title": "How Long Is The Event? How Many Hours Per Day Are We In Session?",
            "text": "<p>The 5-day Immersion course is five (5) full days of education, training, and fun. Training typically starts at 10:00am and will typically go until 8-10pm.</p>"
          }
        },
        "template--20197640634689__05a6ccb4-5008-4aea-bd7b-71a71b3b7286-text_block-4": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "",
            "title": "Will Food And Accommodations Be Provided?",
            "text": "<p>Healthy lunches, snacks, and alkaline water are included. Airfare, transportation, accommodations, extra meals, and services are not included in the event price.</p>"
          }
        },
        "template--20197640634689__05a6ccb4-5008-4aea-bd7b-71a71b3b7286-text_block-5": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "icon": "",
            "title": "Do you cater for Vegetarians or Vegans?",
            "text": "<p>The high end hotels and restaurants we will be visiting serve a variety of Egyptian and Western dishes with plenty of vegetarian options and some vegan options.</p>"
          }
        },
        "template--20197640634689__05a6ccb4-5008-4aea-bd7b-71a71b3b7286-text_block-7": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "icon": "",
            "title": "What service can I expect when traveling with Mohamed Ibrahim?",
            "text": "<p>Mohamed Ibrahim and his company Saba Tours was established 15 years ago and is a member of the Egyptian Travel Agents Association (E.T.A.A)  the International Air Transport Association (IATA). You can expect a professional team with a high level of experience in the field of tourism and touring.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
